# Subtractive-only literal minute count in "MINUTE do HOUR": "petnaest do
# sedam" (fifteen to seven) == 6:45.  Unlike "četvrt" this is not a bare
# fraction word (Serbian never says a bare "*petnaest sedam*"), so it lives
# in its own CLOCKMIN class, valid only alongside CLOCKDIR -- exactly the
# ru "без пятнадцати" shape.  gospeakserbian, "Telling Time in Serbian".
petnaest
петнаест
